      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The time required to decide to seek medical care for acute chest pain is the major modifiable component in the process of care delivery. This study demonstrates that prehospital delay in the setting of acute chest pain was related to the type of health insurance."},
